title: Craig_LoadPhase
---
<<declare $dialoguePhase_Craig = "">>
<<setPhase Craig>>
<<if $dialoguePhase_Craig == "begin">>
<<jump Craig_Begin01>>
<<elseif $dialoguePhase_Craig == "comeback">>
<<jump Craig_Comeback01>>
<<else>>
Craig: All that work just to not make any dialogue.
<<endif>>
===
title: Craig_Begin01
---
<<camMove Craig_CamRig "pc">>
You: *huff... puff....*
<<camMove Craig_CamRig "npc">>
Craig: You ok pal? You look kinda beat.
<<camMove Craig_CamRig "pc">>
You: You think??
You: Can I just have my Maxwell now...
<<camMove Craig_CamRig "npc">>
Craig: Sorry, what?
Craig: I don't know what you're talking about.
<<camMove Craig_CamRig "pc">>
You: ...
<<camMove Craig_CamRig "npc">>
Craig: Haha, got you! Here, take a Maxwell. Sucker.
<<collectMaxwell GameController>>
<<camMove Craig_CamRig "return">>
<<getPhase Craig "comeback">> 
===
title: Craig_Comeback01
---
<<camMove Craig_CamRig "npc">>
Craig: Alright, you can get out of here now. Your heavy breathing is making me uncomfortable.
<<camMove Craig_CamRig "return">>
===